#ASSERT (`Article 1(5) and 1(6) by date: the day on which the enactment comes into force` (`an order naming the day` (YMD 2019 1 1) `made on` (YMD 2018 12 31) `asked about on` NOTHING) `reading b`)'s `the basis` EQUALS `the inferred basis`
#ASSERT (`Article 1(5) and 1(6) by date: the day on which the enactment comes into force` (`an order naming the day` (YMD 2019 1 1) `made on` (YMD 2019 1 1) `asked about on` NOTHING) `reading a`)'s `the day` EQUALS YMD 2019 1 1
#ASSERT (`Article 1(5) and 1(6) by date: the day on which the enactment comes into force` (`an order naming the day` (YMD 2019 1 1) `made on` (YMD 2019 1 1) `asked about on` NOTHING) `reading a`)'s `the basis` EQUALS `the V1 basis`
#ASSERT (`Article 1(5) and 1(6) by date: the day on which the enactment comes into force` (`an order naming the day` (YMD 2019 1 1) `made on` (YMD 2019 1 1) `asked about on` NOTHING) `reading b`)'s `the day` EQUALS YMD 2019 1 1
