-- V1 called directly (the text of 1 January 2019 to 27 September 2021): the same day, read from the deposited text.
#ASSERT (`Article 1(5) and 1(6): the day on which the enactment comes into operation` `V1, 1 January 2019 to 27 September 2021` (`an order naming the day` (YMD 2019 1 1) `made on` (YMD 2018 6 1) `asked about on` NOTHING))'s `the day` EQUALS YMD 2019 1 1
